DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uuppll driver provides support for Prolific PL2301/PL2302 based host-to-
     host USB connectors.

     The uuppll driver appears as a point-to-point network interface and should
     be configured with ifconfig(8) in the same way as other point-to-point
     interfaces.  The uuppll device supports IPv4 only.

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The uuppll driver supports the following adapters from the following ven‐
     dors:

           Aserton
           Bencent
           Butterfly
           Camtel
           Inland
           Longshine
           PC Linq
           Prolific
           StarMount
           Univex
           VVMer

     Belkin, Entrega, and Xircom do _N_O_T use this chip and are not supported by
     this driver.

